{"articleNo":"2407","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2407&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"선 특허출원에 대한 특허등록 및 기술사업화 지원사업","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.06","hit":"12832","attachments":[{"name":"선특허출원지원사업.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2407&attachNo=1484"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"4\"><strong>선 특허출원에 대한 특허등록 및 기술사업화 지원사업</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">□ 배경 및 목적 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;지식재산권 출원장려금 지원사업에 이어 재학생들의 특허출원기술을 분석, 본교 교수 및 전문가의 자문을 통하여 해당 기술을 개량하여 특허 등록은 물론 기술사업화를 추진하고자 함 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">□ 사업개요 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 사업기간 : 공고일로부터 <font size=\"3\">2010. 2. 19(금)<br></font></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 지원대상 : 우리 학교 재학생 명의로 출원한 특허기술<font size=\"3\">70</font>건&nbsp;</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; ○ 지원사업&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">1. 특허 개량발명출원 및 등록 지원</font><br></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(출원한지 1년을 경과하지 않은 출원 건에 한하여 우수기술<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 로 평가된 특허기술)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>2. 기술사업화 지원</strong></font> (기술이전 전문가 자문 지원)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>3. 특허출원</strong></font></font><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong> 및 등록비용 지원</strong>&nbsp;<br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 프로세스</font></span></font></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"></span></font></font>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; B