 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 센터 직접 방문접수&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 메일 및 팩스 접수 (</font></span><a href=\"mailto:kicit@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">kicit@kumoh.ac.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">), Fax 473-8932<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 접수 및 문의 : 산학협력단 산업기술정보센터 (도서관 103호)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;담당 박은희 (☎ 478-7232)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
